      "writtenOn": "2023-01-17T19:01:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I tested this with the AP VDM code for the following cases:\n1. Hotplug \u003d PASS\n2. AP reboot (\"warn reboot\") when connected \u003d  PASS\n3. EC reboot (\"Refresh + Power\") \u003d PASS\n4. `powerd_dbus_suspend --suspend_for_sec\u003d15` (S0ix) \u003d FAIL\n\n\nPASS \u003d WiMaxit Type-C display lights up and renders the extended display correctly\n\nI should check to see if 4. passes on existing EC firmware (i.e without the AP VDM stuff), but I want to save off all my FW state first (lest things break irrevocably).\n\nApart from 4.) seems to be working fine...",
      "revId": "507a3f459996dfc59d4b1ed81161ca43761b0a68",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
