      "writtenOn": "2023-01-17T23:16:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Rather than code the DP logic into the DPM, it seems more modular to do a switch on the SVID and call a function in the appropriate alt mode module that does whatever is appropriate with the VDM. (You\u0027re already sort of doing this anyway?)",
      "revId": "507a3f459996dfc59d4b1ed81161ca43761b0a68",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1fd9f1d9_052e4319",
